  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provisionally improvement of the road/ferry connection accross the Zambeze river. The project included the design of an improved ferry connection and purchase of second hand ferries, technical assistance for ferry operation and maintenance, improvement of access road and construction of ferry landing structures on either sides of the river and training national staff for management and maintenance of ferries</narrative>
